  "DescIdentified": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "Grave-goods of the barrow-kings who held Weathertop before the wights took it. It was made against the two harms that fell on that house -- holy fire and the drain of the wight-cold -- and against the death-magic and the hollowing that came for them anyway. It is proof against neither steel nor sorcery, and was never meant to be."
    }
